---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="OwnTake Terms of Use"
      description="Terms of Use for OwnTake."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <article class="policy tile">
        <p class="tile-kicker">OwnTake</p>
        <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
        <p class="date"><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 2, 2026</p>

        <p>
          These initial terms are a placeholder for the OwnTake public beta and will be updated
          after final legal review. By using OwnTake, you agree to use it lawfully and in accordance
          with these terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Your content and permissions</h2>
        <p>
          You must own the videos, audio, images, and other material you submit, or have all
          permissions needed to use them. You are responsible for the content you upload and for
          reviewing each generated remix before sharing it. Do not submit another creator's media
          merely because it is publicly viewable.
        </p>

        <h2>OwnTake's intended use</h2>
        <p>
          OwnTake analyzes video structure and helps you create an original version with your own
          footage. It is not a downloader, scraper, rights-clearance service, or substitute for
          professional legal advice. You may not use OwnTake to infringe copyright, privacy,
          publicity, or other rights, or to evade a platform's rules.
        </p>

        <h2>Subscriptions and purchases</h2>
        <p>
          Paid plans are purchased through Apple and may be managed or canceled through your Apple
          account settings. Subscription availability, pricing, renewal, refunds, and payment
          processing are governed by Apple's applicable terms. OwnTake does not receive your payment
          card information.
        </p>

        <h2>Generated results</h2>
        <p>
          Generated analysis, scripts, captions, shot plans, and remixes may be incomplete or
          inaccurate. You are responsible for checking the result, rights, claims, music, captions,
          and platform requirements before publishing or relying on it. OwnTake does not promise
          that a generated result will perform, be accepted by a platform, or be free of errors.
        </p>

        <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
        <p>
          Features, limits, models, pricing, and supported export destinations may change as the
          service develops. OwnTake may suspend access when needed for security, maintenance, abuse
          prevention, or legal compliance. The service is provided on an early-access basis while
          these terms remain a placeholder.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:randyventures06@gmail.com">randyventures06@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .policy h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .date {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
</style>
